---
layout: base.njk
---
{# Layout for a single flash-fiction submission page. Chrome (kicker, title,
   author, prompt, AI note, back link) plus the scoped design for the three
   parts lives here; the page body supplies the parts themselves. Everything
   leans on the site's design tokens so it tracks the theme and green accent. #}
<style>
  .ff-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
  }
  .ff-by {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .ff-prompt {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }
  .ff-prompt .ff-prompt-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
  }
  .ff-prompt .ff-prompt-text {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .ff-ai {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .ff-ai::before {
    content: "✳";
    flex: none;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Each of the three parts: a numbered head plus a body panel keeps the
     original, the feedback and the rewrite visibly separate. */
  .ff-part {
    margin: 3.25rem 0 0;
  }
  .ff-part-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }
  .ff-num {
    flex: none;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .ff-part-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .ff-part-head .ff-sub {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .ff-panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top-color: var(--card-topline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.7rem;
  }

  /* Part 1 — the manuscript. */
  .ff-draft p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }
  .ff-draft p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .ff-draft em {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .ff-note {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* Part 2 — the feedback. */
  .ff-fb-group {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }
  .ff-fb-group:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .ff-fb-group > h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ff-fb-group.worked > h3 {
    color: var(--accent-strong);
  }
  .ff-fb-group.didnt > h3 {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .ff-fb-group ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .ff-fb-group li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.55rem 0 0.55rem 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ff-fb-group li:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
  }
  .ff-fb-group li::before {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .ff-fb-group.worked li::before {
    content: "+";
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ff-fb-group.didnt li::before {
    content: "–";
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ff-fb-group strong {
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .ff-principles {
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }
  .ff-principles h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .ff-principles p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Part 3 — the rewrite. */
  .ff-rewrite {
    padding: 1.9rem 2rem;
  }
  .ff-rewrite p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
  }
  .ff-rewrite p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .ff-rewrite em {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>

<article class="post">
  <header class="post-header">
    <p class="ff-kicker">Bleskový príbeh · flash fiction</p>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">
      <time datetime="{{ date | htmlDateString }}">{{ date | readableDate }}</time>
      {%- if participants %}
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span class="ff-by">{{ participants | join(", ") }}</span>
      {%- endif %}
    </p>
  </header>

  {% if prompt %}
  <p class="ff-prompt">
    <span class="ff-prompt-label">Zadanie</span>
    <span class="ff-prompt-text">{{ prompt }}</span>
  </p>
  {% endif %}

  <p class="ff-ai">
    Spätnú väzbu aj prepis vytvorila AI (Claude); pôvodný text je autorov.
  </p>

  {{ content | safe }}
</article>

<p class="back"><a href="/hry-pre-dvojice/">← späť na písacie hry</a></p>
